{"unit_id":"sulfide2085__dsh-skill-manager#card-zh","repo":"sulfide2085/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"5f19e7f9afac64afe8a118d9b1771145d421fbaf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manager 是面向 DSH Web 的技能管理插件，在设置页加入技能管理面板，并通过 host 远程服务连接当前会话。它合并展示 DSH、Agents、Codex 与 Claude 技能及其来源、描述和启用状态，支持单项或目录级启停、查看技能正文、本地 ZIP 安装，以及搜索 GitHub 仓库中的技能并逐项安装。适合需要在一个界面整理多来源 AI 技能的 DSH 用户。GitHub 安装需要联网访问 GitHub；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:861-869","lib/index.js:443-518","lib/index.js:567-663","lib/index.js:692-738"]}
{"unit_id":"sulfide2085__dsh-skill-manager#card-en","repo":"sulfide2085/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"5f19e7f9afac64afe8a118d9b1771145d421fbaf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-manager adds a DSH Web Settings panel for skills from DSH, Agents, Codex, and Claude. Users can browse and toggle skills, view their content, install local ZIP files, and find and install skills from GitHub. Repository installs need GitHub network access; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:861-869","lib/index.js:443-518","lib/index.js:567-663","lib/index.js:692-738"]}
